n or equal to 446 billion SAR may opt not to calculate its CVA capital requirements using the SA-CVA or BA- CVA and instead choose an alternative treatment.","language":"en","languageLabel":"الإنجليزية"}],"imageGallery":[]}],"wordForms":[],"search":"عتبة الأهمية النسبية لتعديل قيمة الائتمان  CVA Materiality Threshold  The materiality threshold for CVA is where aggregate notional amount of non-centrally cleared derivatives is less than or equal to 446 billion SAR may opt not to calculate its CVA capital requirements using the SA-CVA or BA- CVA and instead choose an alternative treatment.","nonDiacriticsLemma":"عتبة الأهمية النسبية لتعديل قيمة الائتمان","metaData":{"periodDateFrom":null,"periodDateTo":null},"lammaDetails":[{"form":"عتبة الأهمية النسبية لتعديل قيمة الائتمان"}],"autoGeneratedRoot":null,"entryRelations":[],"dynamicProps":[]}}
